            <Name>CV Korean Test 25.0 - Noise-Augmented (SCAI)</Name>
            <Title>CV Korean Test 25.0 - Noise-Augmented (SCAI)</Title>
            <Description>This dataset is a noise-augmented version of the test split (test.csv) from the Mozilla Common Voice Scripted Speech 25.0 – Korean dataset, designed to support research in automatic speech recognition (ASR), particularly in noisy environments.
The original clean speech dataset is already hosted on Mozilla Data Collective. Building upon this existing resource, we generate additional versions of the evaluation audio by applying various types of environmental noise while preserving the original transcriptions.
The purpose of this dataset is to enable systematic evaluation of ASR systems under realistic acoustic conditions. The noise augmentation process simulates real-world scenarios such as background noise, allowing researchers to assess model robustness.</Description>
